{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":28.8799991607666,"text":"The loggerhead turtle nests on Greek beaches and lives for decades. The turtles kept here were found dead, and most of them for reasons we made. Plastic bags they mistook for jellyfish, hooks, nets, propellers. It is a hard exhibit, and that is what makes it useful. A turtle needs about 25 years to grow old enough to lay eggs, so every one lost early costs the population far more than a single life.","words":[{"word":"The","start":0,"end":0.5600000023841858},{"word":"loggerhead","start":0.5600000023841858,"end":1.100000023841858},{"word":"turtle","start":1.100000023841858,"end":1.4800000190734863},{"word":"nests","start":1.4800000190734863,"end":1.899999976158142},{"word":"on","start":1.899999976158142,"end":2.2799999713897705},{"word":"Greek","start":2.2799999713897705,"end":2.5},{"word":"beaches","start":2.5,"end":2.8399999141693115},{"word":"and","start":2.8399999141693115,"end":3.4600000381469727},{"word":"lives","start":3.4600000381469727,"end":3.680000066757202},{"word":"for","start":3.680000066757202,"end":4.079999923706055},{"word":"decades","start":4.079999923706055,"end":4.420000076293945},{"word":"The","start":5.119999885559082,"end":5.320000171661377},{"word":"turtles","start":5.320000171661377,"end":5.579999923706055},{"word":"kept","start":5.579999923706055,"end":5.900000095367432},{"word":"here","start":5.900000095367432,"end":6.159999847412109},{"word":"were","start":6.159999847412109,"end":6.440000057220459},{"word":"found","start":6.440000057220459,"end":6.679999828338623},{"word":"dead","start":6.679999828338623,"end":6.960000038146973},{"word":"and","start":7.360000133514404,"end":7.679999828338623},{"word":"most","start":7.679999828338623,"end":7.900000095367432},{"word":"of","start":7.900000095367432,"end":8.239999771118164},{"word":"them","start":8.239999771118164,"end":8.239999771118164},{"word":"for","start":8.239999771118164,"end":8.5},{"word":"reasons","start":8.